      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْلَغُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, effectual or efficacious:</i>
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلِيغٌ</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَنَآءٌ أَبْلَغُ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبَالَغٌ</span></b>  [<i>Praise,</i> or
